     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, I&#39;m working with products (beverages) daily sales divided into groups (pet sodas, red wine, blonde beer, ecc.) . I&#39;m considering a single group for now (pet sodas), with 47 products. <br><br>I don&#39;t want to fit a different model for each product nor fit a single model for all the products, but I want to share information across products. <br><br>What I did is considering 2 groups brand (I have 3 of them) and sugar level (3), basically it is a nested model since for each brand I could have every sugar level (for one brand I don&#39;t, since there is no &#39;light&#39; version for the sugar). <br><br>My covariates are the prices of each product, plus 18 covariates from day of the week to holiday to weather. I have 47+18 covariates, 65, for 729 observations for each product. <br><br>As regards the 18 covariates I put a fixed effect on them, so that their contribution to each product sales is the same for all the products. <br><br>As regards the other 47 I put mixed effects varying by group and mixed effects varying by sugar level. I constrained this to be both positive, since I expect that whichever the product I expect an increase in its price to positively affect 46 products and negatively affect the product itself. That&#39;s why I introduce another effect, for each product, which multiplies its price plus other 3 covariates (intercept, number of promotions and a stockout flag). <br><br>The model then becomes: <br><br><br>$\\lambda_{tijk} = X_t*\\beta + Z_t*(brand_j+sugar_k) + P_{ti}*eta_i$<br>$Y_{tijk}=Poi(exp(\\lambda_{tijk}))$<br><br>First of all I was wondering whether it was possible to write it in rstanarm, since I found documentation about simpler univariate models (here I have a couple of issues I wouldn&#39;t know how to face, i.e. the i and t indexes and the product specific regressors).<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">The</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan looks like </span><span style=\"color:#008\">this</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br><br><br>data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// number of products</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// number of brands</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> S</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// number of sugars/flavours</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//fixed effects matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> Z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//mixed effects matrix (the same for brand and sugar)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> Y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//Sales</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zerobeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//Prior mean on fixed effects</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeroeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//Prior mean on product specific effects</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> zeromix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//Prior mean on mixed effects for sugar and brand</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> brand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">S</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sugar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>row_vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Zeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//matrix for product specific effects</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">//vector&lt;lower=0&gt;[I] phi; </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// random, product specific effects</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> b1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// brand raneffs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> b2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">S</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// sugar raneffs</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>corr_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>corr_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>corr_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_brand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>corr_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_sugar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_be</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_br</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_su</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sigma_et</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>transformed parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>cov_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>cov_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_brand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>cov_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_sugar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>cov_matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_beta</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> quad_form_diag</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma_be</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_brand</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> quad_form_diag</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_brand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma_br</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_sugar</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> quad_form_diag</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_sugar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma_su</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_eta</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> quad_form_diag</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigma_et</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br> beta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zerobeta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> sigma_be </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> sigma_et </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> sigma_br </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> sigma_su </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cauchy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_beta</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lkj_corr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_eta</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lkj_corr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_sugar</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lkj_corr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Omega_brand</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lkj_corr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> eta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zeroeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> b1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zeromix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_brand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> b2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multi_normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">zeromix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma_sugar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">// phi ~ cauchy(0,5);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">l </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">47</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> real </span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> <br> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">beta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Zeta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">l</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">l</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> Z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]*(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">brand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">l</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sugar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">l</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br> <br> Y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">l</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> poisson_log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><br><br><br>I specified positive definite symmetric matrices for all correlation and covariance matrices as initializations. As regards priors for the means I put everything around 0. <br><br>It is very slow, even when running 100 iterations (more than an hour). I don&#39;t know what to try, maybe: <br><br><ul><li>optimizing the stan code in some way? (is there some vectorizing in the model part?) </li><li>putting hyperpriors on the mixed effects means? </li><li>Maybe there&#39;s a problem in the model specification regarding eta?<br><br><br>I&#39;ve been struggling with this for quite a while and I kindly ask for some help.. <br><br>Thank you</li></ul><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></div>"
    ]
